#: ../../tools/mibig_tools.rst:32 fd9c9facc3ea49cfb16e6bc5f979f3fc
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get summary statistics from the MIBiG biosynthetic gene "
"cluster repository. Returns total BGC counts by status (active, retired, "
"complete, partial, pending), counts by biosynthetic class (PKS, NRPS, "
"Terpene, Saccharide, Ribosomal, Other), and counts by source organism "
"phylum (Actinomycetota, Ascomycota, Pseudomonadota, etc.). Essential for "
"understanding the landscape of characterized natural product biosynthesis"
" across the tree of life."
msgstr ""

