#: ../../tools/mibig_tools.rst:61 c25ecf5091724f969cdf84eeb0fd22ac
msgid ""
"**Description**: List biosynthetic gene clusters (BGCs) from the MIBiG "
"repository. MIBiG (Minimum Information about a Biosynthetic Gene Cluster)"
" is the standard repository for experimentally characterized BGCs "
"producing natural products like antibiotics, antifungals, and anticancer "
"compounds. Returns all BGC entries with accession, products, biosynthetic"
" class (PKS, NRPS, Terpene, etc.), organism, quality, and completeness. "
"Contains 3,013 BGC entries from bacteria, fungi, and plants. Use "
"search\\_term to filter results client-side by product name or organism."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/mibig_tools.rst:65 7d16ebaf687e4969b1230846313a9b1c
msgid ""
"``search_term`` (string) (optional) Optional text to filter results by "
"product name or organism. The API returns all entries; filtering is "
"applied client-side. Examples: 'erythromycin', 'vancomycin', "
"'Streptomyces', 'PKS'. Leave empty to get all 3,013 BGC entries."
msgstr ""

